    "description": "Search-time interpreter for raw Linux auditd logs. Adds an `auditsearch` SPL command that decodes arch codes, syscall numbers, hex-encoded fields, and errno exit codes at search time only. no ingestion-time parsing, no scripted input, no dependency on binaries installed on the source hosts.",
